    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When there is a problem downloading the game, please set the language of the Steam client to English first. We are currently working on resolving this issue. We apologize for any inconvenience caused</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Randomly appearing characters and the items they carry</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Dozens of different characters and hundreds of different items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Each character has ten items of varying values</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Thief's insight: Be quick, your time is very limited; every extra second increases the chance of being discovered</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Thief's insight: Be steady, your movements must be very careful; collisions between items can alert your target</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Thief's insight: Be Decisive, obtaining the most valuable items is only the second goal; the first goal is to avoid being caught; strike when the time is right</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal from everyone! Become a legend in the tavern!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When there is a problem downloading the game, please set the language of the Steam client to English first. We are currently working on resolving this issue. We apologize for any inconvenience caused</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Randomly appearing characters and the items they carry</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Dozens of different characters and hundreds of different items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Each character has ten items of varying values</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Thief's insight: Be quick, your time is very limited; every extra second increases the chance of being discovered</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Thief's insight: Be steady, your movements must be very careful; collisions between items can alert your target</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Thief's insight: Be Decisive, obtaining the most valuable items is only the second goal; the first goal is to avoid being caught; strike when the time is right</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal from everyone! Become a legend in the tavern!</p>",
    "short_description": "In the bustling tavern, a variety of people are gathered. It's time to showcase true thieving skills!",
    "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Russian",
